[h2]Build 0.9.100[/h2]
[h3]Fixed[/h3]
[list]
[*]Weight bench: the colonist lifting now lies on their back with their head under the bar, instead of face down the wrong way round.
[/list]

[h2]Build 0.9.99[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*]Workout buffs: a proper session on the fitness equipment now leaves a boost that lasts a day. Weight bench - pumped (carry more, mine and build faster). Exercise bike - good stamina (faster on foot, tire more slowly). Punching bag - sharp (better melee hit and dodge). Bouldering wall - limber (faster on foot, surer of hand).
[*]The weight bench trains mining and construction; the bouldering wall trains construction.
[/list]
[h3]Changed[/h3]
[list]
[*]The punching bag trains melee about five times faster.
[/list]
